---
// Our Culture Section
---

<section class="bg-white py-20 lg:py-24 border-t border-border" data-ps="src/components/agents/AgentsCulture.astro:culture-sec">
  <div class="max-w-[1440px] mx-auto px-6 sm:px-8 lg:px-12" data-ps="src/components/agents/AgentsCulture.astro:vs7wvw">
    <div class="text-center max-w-[680px] mx-auto mb-12" data-ps="src/components/agents/AgentsCulture.astro:vs7wvx">
      <span class="text-[12px] font-bold text-primary tracking-[0.15em] uppercase mb-2 block" data-ps="src/components/agents/AgentsCulture.astro:bqs3gz">Our Culture</span>
      <h2 class="font-heading text-[32px] lg:text-[36px] font-normal text-foreground leading-[1.2]" data-ps="src/components/agents/AgentsCulture.astro:9jy8b3">
        What Drives Our Team
      </h2>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6" data-ps="src/components/agents/AgentsCulture.astro:vs7wvy">
      <div class="bg-surface border border-border p-6 rounded-[8px]" data-ps="src/components/agents/AgentsCulture.astro:vs7wva">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-primary text-white flex items-center justify-center rounded-[6px] mb-4" data-ps="src/components/agents/AgentsCulture.astro:bqs3h0">
          <i class="ri-shield-check-line text-xl" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-heading text-[20px] font-normal text-foreground mb-3" data-ps="src/components/agents/AgentsCulture.astro:54gox6">Honesty First</h3>
        <p class="text-[14px] text-muted-foreground leading-[22px]" data-ps="src/components/agents/AgentsCulture.astro:hrz5m1">
          We tell you the truth about pricing, market conditions, and what your home needs — even when it is hard to hear.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-surface border border-border p-6 rounded-[8px]" data-ps="src/components/agents/AgentsCulture.astro:vs7wvb">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-primary text-white flex items-center justify-center rounded-[6px] mb-4" data-ps="src/components/agents/AgentsCulture.astro:bqs3h2">
          <i class="ri-line-chart-line text-xl" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-heading text-[20px] font-normal text-foreground mb-3" data-ps="src/components/agents/AgentsCulture.astro:54gox5">Data-Driven Decisions</h3>
        <p class="text-[14px] text-muted-foreground leading-[22px]" data-ps="src/components/agents/AgentsCulture.astro:hrz5lz">
          We analyze market data deeply rather than relying on surface-level comparisons, giving you a true competitive edge.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-surface border border-border p-6 rounded-[8px]" data-ps="src/components/agents/AgentsCulture.astro:vs7wvc">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-primary text-white flex items-center justify-center rounded-[6px] mb-4" data-ps="src/components/agents/AgentsCulture.astro:bqs3h4">
          <i class="ri-user-heart-line text-xl" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-heading text-[20px] font-normal text-foreground mb-3" data-ps="src/components/agents/AgentsCulture.astro:54gox4">People Over Profits</h3>
        <p class="text-[14px] text-muted-foreground leading-[22px]" data-ps="src/components/agents/AgentsCulture.astro:hrz5ly">
          Our clients become friends. We measure success by relationships and referrals, not just commission checks.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
